    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσφυ-κτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφύζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without pulsation, lifeless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.647
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.211
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>): metaph. of the mind, <i>without impulse, calm,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.446d
			</span></i>; <i>moderate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν ἰάσιμον ᾖ τὸ χεῖρον καὶ
			ἄ.</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				500c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>causing no violent pulsation,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				132e
			</span></i>.</div>
